{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1425019-\u00e6on-formatting-bioware","id":1425019,"title":"[\u00c6on] Formatting Bioware","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-11-19T14:59:31-08:00","id":1425019,"title":"[\u00c6on] Formatting Bioware","content":"Given that Bioware can readily be formatted at facilities worldwide, would the person performing the procedure be more like a smartphone sales clerk or the doctor at an eyeglass store? At most, they may need a pinprick of blood to get your DNA for the formatting procedure, and they may even be able to get that through a mouth swab. Your bioware dying because they screwed up the procedure would be like a clerk dropping your iPhone.<br /> <br /> I figure this info could be useful for a psiad who wants the benefit of formatted bioware, but is paranoid about being discovered and would prefer to perform the procedure themself. It could even make for an interesting Role Path.<br /> <br /> Bio-Tech<br /> Example Connections: early adopters, Orgotek sales rep, off the books customers (criminal ties)<br /> Skills: Medicine*, Persuasion, Science, Technology*<br /> Edges: Increased Tolerance, Library, Ms. Fix it, Skilled Liar**, Wealth<br /> <br /> *Professional biotech formatters must take at least one dot in Medicine or Technology, since operating the specialized formatting equipment is literally their job. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> *They are selling a product, after all. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25506,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","user":"Shepherdboi","date":".  grammar 11-19-2020, 06:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-19T15:09:07-08:00","id":1425021,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s funny but initially when I read Aberrant Manuscript I was thinking about Attunement in the same way BioWare formatting work, basically the item is made to you and you only can use it, and I took some time to set my mind to \u201cjust focus for some time\u201d, or even that it\u2019s possible to steal someone\u2019s else item.<br /> Now when I think formatting Bioware I think \u201chold the item for a while and it\u2019s ready\u201d and it\u2019s not the case.<br /> <br /> Anyway, the idea is interesting. The guy was working formatting items to people and spending a part of the money on formatting items on himself until he noticed he could format more items them usual and went to test his latency.<br /> <br /> No he works developing bioware instead of formatting to people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents",